          "description": "Local carpenter who buys lunch meat and beer twice a week, tips in awkward compliments, and once helped Jane move a broken cooler. Friendly orbit, not a confidant; she clocks that he lingers.",
          "currentTension": "Asked if she ever gets a real night off in a way that felt like a soft ask-out; she deflected with a roast and now feels weird ringing him up."
